WEBVTT

00:00:12.448 --> 00:00:15.040
<v><b>I:</b></v> What do you usually have for breakfast?

00:00:15.041 --> 00:00:20.235
<v><b>J:</b></v> Um, just toast and a cup of tea, maybe.

00:00:28.391 --> 00:00:31.283
<v><b>I:</b></v> Do you live in a house or a flat?

00:00:31.456 --> 00:00:32.389
<v><b>H:</b></v> It’s a house.

00:00:32.629 --> 00:00:33.589
<v><b>I:</b></v> Where is it?

00:00:34.126 --> 00:00:36.560
<v><b>H:</b></v> It’s in Stockport, outside Manchester.

00:00:45.550 --> 00:00:47.096
<v><b>I:</b></v> Do you have children?

00:00:47.216 --> 00:00:50.552
<v><b>L:</b></v> I have children, yes I do. I have one son.

00:00:51.420 --> 00:00:53.126
He is sixteen.

00:01:01.594 --> 00:01:02.834
<v><b>I:</b></v> What do you do?

00:01:03.100 --> 00:01:04.533
<v><b>S:</b></v> I’m retired.

00:01:04.796 --> 00:01:06.678
<v><b>I:</b></v> Do you like being retired?

00:01:07.370 --> 00:01:10.333
<v><b>S:</b></v> I do … very much.

00:01:20.220 --> 00:01:22.720
<v><b>I:</b></v> What time do you get up during the week?

00:01:23.013 --> 00:01:26.601
<v><b>K:</b></v> Um, quite early. Usually before 8 a.m.

00:01:26.860 --> 00:01:28.149
<v><b>I:</b></v> And at weekends?

00:01:28.540 --> 00:01:32.030
<v><b>K:</b></v> At the weekends, much later. About 10 a.m.